@startuml maturity-anti-patterns
title AVS Maturity Anti-Patterns (CR-VAS-006 §21)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Maturity is NOT..." as Misconceptions {
}

rectangle "Autonomy" as AP1
rectangle "AI\nSophistication" as AP2
rectangle "Agent\nCount" as AP3
rectangle "Automation\nPercentage" as AP4
rectangle "Intervention\nReduction" as AP5
rectangle "Cost\nReduction" as AP6
rectangle "Production\nDeployment" as AP7
rectangle "Semantic\nComplexity" as AP8

Misconceptions --> AP1
Misconceptions --> AP2
Misconceptions --> AP3
Misconceptions --> AP4
Misconceptions --> AP5
Misconceptions --> AP6
Misconceptions --> AP7
Misconceptions --> AP8

note bottom of Misconceptions
  Maturity is a property of organizational capability,
  not a single metric. Reject all eight patterns.
end note

@enduml
